    </nav>
  </header>
  <main id="top">
    <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title"><div class="hero-inner wrap">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <div class="eyebrow">Your skills. A wider horizon.</div>
        <h1 class="display" id="hero-title">Discover<br/>where your<br/>skills <span class="blue">belong.</span></h1>
        <p class="body-copy">Upload your résumé, review what the system understands, and explore cybersecurity career paths grounded in your actual experience.</p>
        <div class="hero-actions"><a href="/resumes" class="btn btn--dark">Explore my paths <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 12h16m-7-7 7 7-7 7"/></svg></a><a href="#how" class="btn btn--light">See how it works <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="m10 8 6 4-6 4z"/></svg></a></div>
        <div class="micro-line"><span><i class="dot"></i> Evidence-backed</span><span><i class="dot"></i> Human-reviewed</span><span><i class="dot"></i> No hiring promises</span></div>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-visual" aria-label="Abstract royal-blue Orbital square with skill nodes exploring connected career paths" role="img">
        <div class="graphic-panel"></div><div class="graphic-grid"></div>
        <span class="visual-caption">ORBITAL / 001</span>
        <svg class="graphic-art" viewBox="0 0 680 600" aria-hidden="true">
          <defs><filter id="softShadow" x="-40%" y="-40%" width="180%" height="180%"><feDropShadow dx="0" dy="20" stdDeviation="21" flood-color="#19378b" flood-opacity=".22"/></filter><clipPath id="orbSquare"><rect x="175" y="159" width="330" height="310" rx="70" transform="rotate(-13 340 310)"/></clipPath></defs>
          <path d="M80 502 580 54" stroke="#2855e8" stroke-width="1" opacity=".22"/><path d="M125 65H565M100 536H650" stroke="#2855e8" opacity=".15"/>
          <ellipse class="orbit-ring" cx="351" cy="310" rx="276" ry="141" transform="rotate(-26 351 310)"/>
          <ellipse cx="355" cy="302" rx="225" ry="235" fill="#e7efff" opacity=".9"/>
          <rect x="175" y="159" width="330" height="310" rx="70" transform="rotate(-13 340 310)" fill="#2855e8" filter="url(#softShadow)"/>
          <g clip-path="url(#orbSquare)"><path d="m132 168 420-55-136 235-242 52z" fill="#101116"/><path d="M165 395 411 338 529 517 202 555z" fill="#1643d6"/><path d="m414 341 144-230 29 413-81-8z" fill="#fff"/><path d="m147 380 270-38 89 28-236 192z" fill="#fff"/><path d="m301 213 189-39-75 159-247 61z" fill="#101116"/><path d="m209 402 214-56 60 19-188 104z" fill="#e9f1ff"/></g>
          <path d="M179 399c78-45 165-46 254-81 45-19 89-42 123-87" fill="none" stroke="#2855e8" stroke-width="6" stroke-linecap="round"/>
          <g class="orbit-spin"><circle cx="585" cy="177" r="13" fill="#2855e8"/><circle cx="122" cy="462" r="7" fill="#101116"/></g>
          <circle cx="584" cy="177" r="13" fill="#2855e8"/><circle cx="126" cy="455" r="7" fill="#101116"/>
          <path d="M556 467l15-15m-7 17 7-17-17 5" fill="none" stroke="#141820" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
        </svg>
        <div class="floating-pill pill-one"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2855e8" stroke-width="2.6"><path d="M4 18V12m5 6V5m5 13V9m5 9V3"/></svg> SIEM</div>
        <div class="floating-pill pill-two"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2855e8" stroke-width="2.1"><path d="m8 5-6 7 6 7M16 5l6 7-6 7M14 3 10 21"/></svg> Python</div>
        <div class="floating-pill pill-three"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#2855e8" stroke-width="2.1"><rect x="4" y="3" width="16" height="18" rx="3"/><circle cx="12" cy="9" r="2.3"/><path d="M8 17c0-4 8-4 8 0"/></svg> Identity & access</div>
        <div class="visual-note">SAME SKILLS.<br/>MORE WAYS<br/>FORWARD.<svg viewBox="0 0 40 40" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M3 10Q7 31 33 29M24 21l9 8-10 4"/></svg></div>
      </div>
    </div></section>

    <section id="upload" class="resume-section" aria-labelledby="upload-title"><div class="resume-wrap wrap">
      <div class="section-heading-row"><span class="section-number">01</span><span class="eyebrow">Your journey starts here</span></div>
      <div class="resume-grid">
        <div class="resume-intro"><h2 class="section-title" id="upload-title">Turn your résumé into possibilities.</h2><p class="body-copy">Your experience is more than a job title. Start with the facts, then discover the directions they support.</p></div>
        <div class="white-card upload-card"><div class="card-head"><span class="section-number">1</span> Upload your résumé</div><div class="upload-target"><svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M11 4h19l9 9v31H11zM30 4v9h9M17 24h16M17 31h16M17 38h11"/></svg><strong>Your next chapter starts with what you've done.</strong><p>Upload and review your résumé in your private workspace.</p><a class="btn btn--dark" href="/resumes">Go to résumé upload ↗</a><p>PDF or DOCX • Processed through the existing S1 flow</p></div></div>
